{
  "about": "project 作用域的任务预算（ProjectRuntimeRegistry.ts:1408-1453 configureProjectTaskBudget、2222-2237 账本键）：同一项目的不同 SDK 会话共用一份账本（sessionKey 记成 *）；首次配置追加 configured 记录，之后 total 不同就回 SDK_PROJECT_TASK_BUDGET_TOTAL_CONFLICT「Project taskBudget.total is fixed at ...」。s-p1 一轮花 0.04 越过 0.03（轮内 task_budget），s-p2 是另一个会话、提交前就被拒，s-p3 用不同 total 配置被拒。PILOTDECK_SDK_TASK_BUDGET_LEDGER_COMPACT_AFTER_RECORDS=2 让账本在 configured + settled 两条之后压成一条 snapshot（1511-1540：写临时文件再改名）。只让一轮记账：snapshot 的 settledRunIds 按字符串排序，两个随机 run id 的先后两侧都随机，比较器按出现顺序编号 UUID，会时有时无地报差异。",
  "env": {
    "PILOTDECK_SDK_TASK_BUDGET_LEDGER_COMPACT_AFTER_RECORDS": "2"
  },
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\":\"Task budget\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "p",
      "when": [
        "tbp"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Project.",
        "usage": {
          "prompt_tokens": 12,
          "completion_tokens": 4,
          "total_tokens": 16,
          "cost": 0.04
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-p1",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "tbp1: spend",
        "sdkSessionConfig": {
          "taskBudget": {
            "total": 0.03,
            "scope": "project"
          }
        }
      },
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "sleep": 300
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-p2",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "tbp2: refused",
        "sdkSessionConfig": {
          "taskBudget": {
            "total": 0.03,
            "scope": "project"
          }
        }
      },
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "sleep": 300
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-p3",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "tbp3: other total",
        "sdkSessionConfig": {
          "taskBudget": {
            "total": 0.5,
            "scope": "project"
          }
        }
      },
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "sleep": 300
    }
  ],
  "name": "loop-task-budget-project"
}
